"about.body" = "ShouldRest %@\n\nShouldRest is a Mac-first rest reminder built around short, frequent, hard-to-ignore Eye Gates and configurable Body Breaks.\n\nIt keeps scheduling, automation, updates, diagnostics, and preferences available where they support the product goal, while replacing easy-to-dismiss 20-second rests with stricter eye-rest enforcement.";
